Structurer of Game:
-------------------Scene---------------------
Splash Scene :

|_____SplashBG
|     |____LOGO
|     |____GlowInner
      |____GlowOuter
      |____Footer

MainMenu Scene:

Canvas
│
└── SafeArea
    │
    ├── HeaderBar
    │   ├── Logo (Left / Center)
    │   ├── ProfileButton (Right – avatar circle)
    │   └── SettingsButton (Top-right small icon)
    │
    ├── MainContentArea
    │   ├── HomePanel        ⭐ default visible
    │   ├── ProfilePanel     (Hidden)
    │   ├── SettingsPanel    (Hidden)
    │   └── LobbyPanel       (Hidden – Friends mode)
    │
    └── FooterBar
        ├── HomeTabButton
        ├── FriendsTabButton
        └── ProfileTabButton

HomePanel (Main Play Screen):


HomePanel
│
├── WelcomeText
│   └── "Welcome, Richa 👋"
│
├── PlayCardContainer
│   ├── PlayOfflineCard
│   │   ├── Icon
│   │   ├── TitleText ("Play Offline")
│   │   └── Subtitle ("Play on same device")
│   │
│   ├── PlayFriendsCard
│   │   ├── Icon
│   │   ├── TitleText ("Play with Friends")
│   │   └── Subtitle ("Online multiplayer")
│   │
│   └── PlayComputerCard
│       ├── Icon
│       ├── TitleText ("Play vs Computer")
│       └── Subtitle ("Practice with AI")
│
└── TipText (optional)
    └── "Tip: You can play offline without internet"

ProfilePanel:


ProfilePanel
│
├── AvatarSection
│   └── AvatarImage (Circle – static)
│
├── PlayerNameSection
│   ├── LabelText ("Player Name")
│   └── NameInputField (editable)
│
└── SaveButton



LobbyPanel (Friends Mode – UI only):

LobbyPanel
│
├── PlayerInfoBar
│   └── PlayerNameText
│
├── RoomSection
│   ├── RoomCodeText
│   ├── CopyRoomCodeButton
│   └── RoomCodeInput (Join)
│
├── PlayerList
│   ├── PlayerSlot_1 (You)
│   └── PlayerSlot_2 (Waiting / Joined)
│
└── ActionButtons
    ├── CreateRoomButton
    ├── JoinRoomButton
    └── StartGameButton (Host only)

SettingsPanel:


SettingsPanel
│
├── Title ("Settings")
│
├── SoundSettings
│   ├── MusicToggle
│   └── SFXToggle
│
├── GameSettings
│   ├── TimerDropdown (5 / 10 / 15 min)
│   ├── BoardThemeSelector
│   └── PieceThemeSelector
│
└── CreditsButton

OfflineGameScene:


GamePanelBG
│
├── Header
│   ├── BackButton
│   └── TimerPanel
│       ├── WhitePlayerTime
│       └── BlackPlayerTime
│
├── DestroyedPieceForOpponent
│   └── CapturedGrid_Black
│
├── ChessBoard
│
├── DestroyedPieceForPlayer
│   └── CapturedGrid_White
│
├── Footer
│   ├── TurnText
│   ├── StatusText
│   └── ActionButtonPanel
│       ├── DrawButton
│       └── ResignButton
│
└── PopupPanel (Hidden) ⭐ SINGLE POPUP
    ├── TitleText
    ├── MessageText
    └── ButtonPanel
        ├── LeftButton   (Red)
        └── RightButton  (Blue)




